WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.911
A reflection is a mirror image across a line. Every point stays the same distance

00:00:04.911 --> 00:00:05.853
from the line.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:12.551
Reflect (3, 3) in the y-axis. The answer is (-3, 3). Reflection in the y-axis changes

00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:14.380
the sign of x only.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.243
A point during a library project has coordinates (1, 7). Reflect it across the

00:00:20.243 --> 00:00:24.565
vertical y-axis. What is the new point? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:30.461
A point during a library project has coordinates (1, 7). Reflect it across the

00:00:30.461 --> 00:00:35.918
vertical y-axis. What is the new point? The answer is (-1, 7). Reflection in the

00:00:35.918 --> 00:00:38.465
y-axis changes the sign of x only.
